<!--
    The monogram again, cropped to itself, for use inside the app.

    The same drawing as ic_launcher_foreground.xml and not a reference to it,
    because the launcher's copy is padded: two thirds of that 108x108 canvas is
    margin the launcher needs for masking, and a mark drawn at 56dp on a screen
    with that much air around it is a mark at 36dp with a gap. This one is fitted
    to its own outline, so the size a caller asks for is the size it gets.

    Its ink is white and means nothing — tinted at the call site, the way every
    vendored glyph in this folder is.
-->
